<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- NY State Electric raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- NY State Electric raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs on Monday said it upgraded New York State Electric &amp; Gas Corp to market outperform.</p>
<p>-- The company said the stock was previously rated market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- NYSEG rose 7/16 to 24-13/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
